WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:06.961
Bean Trader is a card game about farming, and mostly about making deals. Two to seven players.

2
00:00:07.661 --> 00:00:15.619
Here's the rule that changes everything. You can never rearrange your hand. The card at the front is the next one you have to plant.

3
00:00:15.769 --> 00:00:17.907
So you'll need your friends to help you out.

4
00:00:18.607 --> 00:00:29.486
Each turn, you plant the first card of your hand into one of your fields. A field can only hold one kind of bean. Then two new cards are turned face up, and the trading begins.

5
00:00:29.636 --> 00:00:36.077
Anyone can make an offer, and you accept or decline. Every trade involves whoever's turn it is.

6
00:00:36.777 --> 00:00:46.013
Everything you receive has to be planted right away. No room? Harvest a field first, and turn those beans into coins, using the price chart.

7
00:00:46.163 --> 00:00:48.565
Bigger fields of rarer beans pay more.

8
00:00:49.265 --> 00:00:58.617
The game ends when the draw pile has run out three times. Most coins wins. Donating a card to someone who needs it makes friends, and favours.
